WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.947 --> 00:00:05.267
When you build with Leavitt Building Group, you get Leavitt Connect: your new home,

2
00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:08.777
on your phone, from the first day of construction to closing.

3
00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:11.408
Here’s a two-minute look at what you’ll see.

4
00:00:11.408 --> 00:00:14.638
It’s a sample home, so the names and numbers aren’t real.

5
00:00:18.421 --> 00:00:20.281
There’s no password to remember.

6
00:00:20.281 --> 00:00:23.841
You sign in with a code we email you, or with Face ID.

7
00:00:24.423 --> 00:00:28.113
Your home page shows where the build is now, what’s next,

8
00:00:28.113 --> 00:00:32.445
your price with every change included, and key dates like closing.

9
00:00:35.606 --> 00:00:38.276
The full schedule is there, phase by phase,

10
00:00:38.276 --> 00:00:41.056
and Leavitt keeps it current as the job moves.

11
00:00:42.764 --> 00:00:46.094
Every finish and fixture you’ve chosen is in one place,

12
00:00:46.094 --> 00:00:47.674
with the date you signed off.

13
00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.050
Changes are never a surprise.

14
00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.840
Each change order spells out what’s changing, what it costs,

15
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:00.860
and how it affects the schedule, and you sign it securely online.

16
00:01:01.442 --> 00:01:03.792
Once it’s signed, your price updates,

17
00:01:03.792 --> 00:01:06.762
and the signed copy is saved with your documents.

18
00:01:10.109 --> 00:01:14.859
Walk-through punch lists include photos of what was found, and how it was fixed.

19
00:01:16.844 --> 00:01:21.004
You can follow every county inspection, and keep your contract,

20
00:01:21.004 --> 00:01:23.650
plans, permits, and warranties in one place.

21
00:01:25.124 --> 00:01:28.414
When there’s news, you get a short email, never a flood.

22
00:01:28.414 --> 00:01:33.094
And behind the scenes, Leavitt’s office and trade partners work in the same system,

23
00:01:33.094 --> 00:01:34.754
so it all stays up to date.

24
00:01:35.992 --> 00:01:39.872
That’s Leavitt Connect, one more way building with Leavitt is different.

25
00:01:39.872 --> 00:01:45.582
To talk about your new home, call (866) 832-6524.
